  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Gonna be real simple with what I say here, change the age of kids allowed on the platform from 13 to 16, put in an age verification, put in the ability to report a child under the age in the moderation settings. We can't keep allowing kids onto VRChat like this, it ain't right.\n\nBefore some says \"its up to the parents to moderate what their children play.\" Yes I agree 100%, it should be up to the parents, but they don't always know, they can think a Quest 2 or something is just like any other game console, but every other game console has a screen for parents to see, and the games aren't as personal as VRC can be. \n\nWe need to do what we can to stop kids from being put in bad situations, because duty of care is just as much on VRChat as it is the parents. \n\nPlease VRChat, do more, say more. I do what I can to share to parents I know, but I can only do so much on my end.",
